#3101
Midgaard Thief Q --> Ian's Best~
Filthy the bartender is prepared to pay a small fortune for Ian's new recipe.
Go to Common Street, there you will find the entrance to Ian & Ian Brewery.
Somewhere in the building is a locked cooler with a bottle of Ian's best inside.
Pick the cooler, steal the bottle away, and bring it back to me.
~
Go to Ian & Ian Brewery and locate a locked cooler.  Inside you should find a
bottle of Ian's Best.  Bring it back to the young pickpocket and collect your
reward!    
~
