A young pickpocket looks up from behind his storeroom counter and grins at you.
The pickpocket says, 'Ahah, Ian's Best.  Filthy will be extremely pleased, but
he better be willing to pay for such delight!  ' The young pickpocket pulls out
a small chest and draws out a pouch of gold coins.  He throws you the pouch and
with a wink says, 'here is your cut of the action'.    

You get a pile of gold coins from a velvet pouch. 
There were 2,500 &10coins&00.
