#3102
Mid ThiefQ --> Rat's Lair Gems~
A good thief must learn how to distinguish between wealth and trash.
Therefore, your next job requires you to visit the Midgaard dump.
Below the dump you will find an entrance to a sewer that is home to subterranean creatures.
These "packrat" creatures have stowed away precious gems within the sewer walls.
Find two rubies and two sapphires, bring the loot back to the storeroom.
~
Go to the Midgaard dump and locate the entrance to the sewers.  Avoid the
subterranean creatures and find the treasure in the sewer labyrinth!  Bring
back two rubies and two sapphires.    
~
