The young pickpocket holds up the gems to the dim light, looks over at you, and
gives a solemn nod.  A young pickpocket says, 'Very nice work, you have an eye
for the good stuff!  ' He pulls out a long wand from behind the counter and
points it at you.  The pickpocket says, 'You already have a sharp eye, let's
see how you do with a little help'.    
~
